{"unit_id":"WieHeistDu119__ctf-agent-deepseek-harness-#card-zh","repo":"WieHeistDu119/ctf-agent-deepseek-harness-","commit":"995842f884e5c7b1033f1d80c6c23c462ccdb419","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ctf-agent-cluster 是面向 DSH Web 的 CTF 多层级 agent 编排插件。它在对话界面提供集群面板，并注册状态查看、比赛事件与题目管理、agent 委派、进度记录和 flag 提交等工具。用户层可启动集群，管理层按题目和角色派发 boss、席位及 solver agent，浏览器面板通过 RPC 查看状态、绑定会话并处理留言或人工提交确认。适合希望在 DSH 中组织比赛题目获取、多人 agent 解题和结果跟踪的用户。DASCTF API 凭据按需配置；工作区用于保存状态与题目材料。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-75","lib/tools.js:344-425","lib/client.js:103-118"]}
{"unit_id":"WieHeistDu119__ctf-agent-deepseek-harness-#card-en","repo":"WieHeistDu119/ctf-agent-deepseek-harness-","commit":"995842f884e5c7b1033f1d80c6c23c462ccdb419","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ctf-agent-cluster coordinates CTF agents in DSH Web. Its panel shows cluster status; tools manage challenges, delegation, progress, and flag submission. Managers assign role-based agents to challenges. Users can bind a session and confirm manual submissions. Configure DASCTF access when needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-75","lib/tools.js:344-425","lib/client.js:103-118"]}
